# Local-only secrets. Copy to .env (gitignored, never commit).
# No variables are required to build or run this site.
# Canonical URL lives in src/site.ts because it ships in public HTML.
# Cloudflare Pages: build command `bun run build`, output directory `dist`,
# production branch `main`, custom domain angelortegamelton.com. Pin Bun
# with BUN_VERSION if a build-image update breaks the build.
# No DNS records exist for that domain yet, so this repo cannot publish it.
# Account settings can override dist/robots.txt: Block AI bots and Managed
# robots.txt change crawler rules.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/bots/additional-configurations/custom-rules/
# Preview Cloudflare routing locally: bun run build && bunx wrangler pages dev dist
# Dev and preview bind localhost only. Add `--host` to opt into the LAN.
# Direct HTTP requests to src/content/blog/** are denied in dev; the app reads
# posts through the Vite virtual module, so drafts stay unpublished.
# EXAMPLE_KEY=replace-me
